{"title":"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/0/3106a3081012ce5c0402df3bb3cefa744452fd82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{3}{4} + \\frac{n}{12} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"163\" height=\"38\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/1/511ab157358863d6e4087651954137e654ddf8e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ -4 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 13 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 18 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 4 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"428\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to get rid of the denominators, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/a/a0a5daf2dd35069591ae7fd942a35f4aad5b4987.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12(\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{3}{4} + \\frac{n}{12}) = 2 \\times 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"236\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/8/6c88f7f02fb34cde377b6800cc14ecb778ae2d4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 \\times \\frac{1}{2} + 12 \\times \\frac{2}{3} + 12 \\times \\frac{3}{4} + 12 \\times \\frac{n}{12} = 2 \\times 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"365\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f505a0a218c623cf6c8f51bf94e009e4594e37b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 + 8 + 9 + n = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"149\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/5/d35dde2c7b186a9ee997e94bcd111766b14367c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n + 23 = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"96\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/7/f97231f7ce8145320b1dca21258753eb6593ca47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 24 - 23 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"174\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal\">2006 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a hre